menu "Flipforge Bridge"

config FLIPFORGE_ACTIVITY_LED
    bool "Flash onboard RGB LED for RPC data"
    default y
    help
        Pulse the official Wi-Fi Devboard's blue LED when actual RPC payload
        bytes move between the Flipper and the Wi-Fi client. Heartbeats and
        status frames do not trigger the LED.

config FLIPFORGE_DEBUG_METRICS
    bool "Enable DEBUG transport metrics"
    default n
    help
        Collect byte counts, frame counts, ACK timing, queue utilization,
        retries, and protocol errors. Metrics never include RPC payloads.

endmenu
